<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n828" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄγρ-ευμα</span></b> , τό, in pl.,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ ἐπὶ τῆς ἀγροικίας
					κτήματα</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Sol.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				<u>AB</u>
				340
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>that which is taken in hunting, prey</i>, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Ba.</u>
				1241
			</span></i>: metaph., <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Mem.</u>
				3.11.7
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄ. ἀνθέων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					754
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>means of catching</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄ. θηρός</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Ch.</u>
					998
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐντὸς . . μορσίμων ἀ.</span>,
			of the <i>net</i> thrown over Agamemnon, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Ag.</u>
				1048
			</span></i>, cf.<i><span class="en">
				<u>Eu.</u>
				460
			</span></i>.</div>
